Sir Robert Baden-Pal.

343
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,520
Sir Robert,

344
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:47,920
Good luck to you and good camping,

345
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:49,840
Why? thank you, sir.

346
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:51,040
